        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Emily Bergl, Jeff Daniels\n- Works: Men in Trees, Desperate Housewives, Southland, Shameless, Chasing Sleep\n- Organizations: ABC, TNT, Showtime\n- Places: Chicago, Los Angeles\n- Topics: television roles, filming locations\n\nFacts:\n- In 1999, Emily Bergl was best known for playing Rachel Lang in a supernatural horror film.\n- Emily Bergl was best known for playing Annie O'Donnell on ABC's Men in Trees from 2006 to 2008.\n- Emily Bergl was best known for playing Tammi Bryant on TNT's Southland from 2009 to 2013.\n- Emily Bergl was best known for playing Beth Young on Desperate Housewives from 2010 to 2011.\n- Emily Bergl was best known for playing Sammi Slott in Shameless from 2014 to 2015.\n- Shameless is an American comedy-drama television series that airs on Showtime.\n- Shameless is set in Chicago and filmed in Los Angeles, with exterior scenes shot in Chicago.\n- Chasing Sleep stars Jeff Daniels and Emily Bergl.",
